<title>UK: London Forfaiting spike on 1996 results.</title>
<headline>London Forfaiting spike on 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in London Forfaiting Co spiked up on Wednesday after the company announced a 40 percent increase in 1996 pre-tax profits, traders said.</p>
<p>London Forfaiting shares were 28-1/2p higher at 386p by 1023 GMT.</p>
</text>
